<section class="auth-section"><div class="container"><div class="auth-shell"><div class="auth-aside"><span class="section-kicker">Sumate</span><h1>Una cuenta.<br>Menos vueltas.</h1><p>Creá tu cuenta para confirmar compras y seguir pedidos.</p><ul><li>Seguimiento de pedidos</li><li>Datos centralizados</li><li>Experiencia personalizada</li></ul></div><div class="auth-card"><h2>Crear cuenta</h2><p class="auth-card__intro">Tus contraseñas se almacenan cifradas.</p><form action="<?=e(url('register'))?>" method="post"><?=csrf_input()?><div class="row g-3"><div class="col-sm-6 form-field"><label for="first-name">Nombre *</label><input class="form-control" id="first-name" name="first_name" maxlength="100" autocomplete="given-name" required></div><div class="col-sm-6 form-field"><label for="last-name">Apellido *</label><input class="form-control" id="last-name" name="last_name" maxlength="100" autocomplete="family-name" required></div><div class="col-12 form-field"><label for="register-email">Correo electrónico *</label><input class="form-control" id="register-email" name="email" type="email" maxlength="254" autocomplete="email" required></div><div class="col-12 form-field"><label for="register-password">Contraseña *</label><input class="form-control" id="register-password" name="password" type="password" minlength="12" autocomplete="new-password" required><small>Usá al menos 12 caracteres.</small></div></div><button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg w-100 mt-4" type="submit">Crear cuenta</button></form><p class="auth-switch">¿Ya tenés una cuenta? <a href="<?=e(url('login'))?>">Iniciar sesión</a></p></div></div></div></section>
